{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Let's be on our way.": "",
  "(I'm short... Guess I'm walking.)": "",
  "What kind of gift is it?": "",
  "Hey... Wanna learn about our music fair today?": "",
  "Simple. You spend 700 yen, you earn 1 point. Get 10 points, you earn 1 gift. That's all there is to it.": "",
  "A limited-edition record.": "",
  "Every branch in Kamurocho carries a different one. The point is to collect them all. I mean, that's only if you wanted to.": "",
  "Yeah. Give it your best shot.": "",
  "Thanks. With the purchase you've made today, your point total's up by <t:get_poppo_point>.": "",
  "Right now you have a <t:now_poppo_point=friend_033_kizuna_point>-point total.": "",
  "Once you get 10, we'll hook you up with a sick new record.": "",
  "Please come again.": "",
  "Nice. You finally got 10 points.": "",
  "Keep this limited-edition record, sir.": "",
  "(Hm? Isn't that...)": "",
  "Who the fuck do you think you are, asking for protection money here!? You asshats forget this is Matsugane turf!?": "",
  "I think you mean it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> Matsugane turf. Word on the street is, your patriarch's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>dead</font_kind>.": "",
  "For the longest time, Captain Hamura was the man in charge around here... but that's in the past now.": "",
  "We'll be handling this store from here on out, so why don't you go run along now!?": "",
  "Tch...! Fuckin' pricks.": "",
  "(It's Tashiro-kun... Who's that he's arguing with...?)": "",
  "Think about it. You're about to get beat to death, maybe halfway if I'm feeling generous. And for what?": "",
  "Loyalty? To a piece of shit like Matsugane? You got some daddy issues, kid. Now beat it before I really get pissed.": "",
  "...Shut the fuck up.": "",
  "I said, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>shut the fuck up</font_kind>!!! I swore an oath to the Matsugane Family, and I'm always ready to back it up. Even with my life!": "",
  "I'm not the kind of bastard who'd abandon his patriarch just because he died. Can you say the same for yourself?": "",
  "(Wow... Tashiro-kun, you're more of a man than I thought.)": "",
  "Heh. You're pathetic, just like that patriarch of yours. You really wanna follow in his footsteps?": "",
  "Then I'll send you to meet him in hell!": "",
  "Huh? Yagami!?": "",
  "Can't you see you're interrupting family business? Besides, it has nothing to do with you!": "",
  "Actually, it has everything to do with me.": "",
  "I never swore an oath, but I've always respected Matsugane-san. He was like a father to me.": "",
  "I still owe him a lot... so I can't just let these people insult him like that.": "",
  "What the hell, Yagami...": "",
  "Sorry to butt in, Tashiro-kun. But this is my fight, too.": "",
  "You done spouting off that bullshit? 'Cause these are gonna be your last words!": "",
  "Gah...!": "",
  "You like that, huh!? That'll teach you not to fuck with the Matsugane Family!": "",
  "Damn you...": "",
  "You all right, Tashiro-kun?": "",
  "Don't ask me that shit! I coulda handled those guys on my own!": "",
  "Come on, man. I was just trying to set things straight.": "",
  "Tch...! Whatever, dude. Don't expect a thank-you.": "",
  "(Man, Tashiro-kun's really got a stick up his ass... Wonder what happened?)": "",
  "Hey... Aren't you the guy who rescued Tashiro-san the other day?": "",
  "Well, I just saw him get dragged off by those yakuza from before! It was horrible!": "",
  "What? You mean they came back for revenge?": "",
  "I think so. Those guys have been popping up everywhere these days, all in an attempt to leech away our profit.": "",
  "Makes you wonder if the Tojo Clan's going through a turf war.": "",
  "I really wouldn't know... Maybe there's some kind of rift within the organization? Is that usually a thing that happens?": "",
  "Probably not too often. But given that the Matsugane Family recently lost their patriarch and their captain's in the hot seat...": "",
  "It seems like their men are left running wild in the streets.": "",
  "Anyway. Do you have any idea where they might have gone?": "",
  "Who knows... I'm sure they couldn't have gone too far, though.": "",
  "(Now where would a yakuza go to teach someone a lesson...)": "",
  "(Didn't Tashiro-kun rough up a civilian that one time?)": "",
  "(Yeah... That was... in that shady back lot just off Tenkaichi Street! Bingo!)": "",
  "Hey. You guys are done here.": "",
  "Y-You again... Yagami? *cough cough*": "",
  "You look like shit, Tashiro-kun. What'd they do, beat your clothes up first?": "",
  "This motherfucker...! Heh, well, that's fine. Now I can get rid of both of you clowns at once!": "",
  "I wouldn't be so sure.": "",
  "It's not a matter of that. When I make the decision to off someone... then it may as well have already happened. Get ready to die!": "",
  "You okay, Tashiro-kun?": "",
  "Fuck off, man! I said I didn't need your help the first time!": "",
  "Besides, civilians shouldn't be messing around with the yakuza anyway.": "",
  "Are you even aware what could happen to you...?": "",
  "Doesn't matter. Whether I'm yakuza or not, there's no way I'd abandon a guy like you.": "",
  "Even though Matsugane-san is gone...": "",
  "...That doesn't mean I stopped caring about the family.": "",
  "Tashiro-kun. You stood up for more than just yourself back there. That's the kind of thing that makes me proud... Matsugane-san would be too.": "",
  "...Who even says that kinda shit? You really are an idiot, man.": "",
  "I'm being serious. Now can you get home by yourself, or do you need me to call an ambulance?": "",
  "What I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>need</font_kind> is for you to leave me the fuck alone!": "",
  "Fine. Then I'm gone.": "",
  "...Hold up.": "",
  "...I owe you one.": "",
  "Heh. You don't owe me a thing, man. Just do you.": "",
  "(Looks like Tashiro-kun's in trouble... Should I help him out?)": "",
  "I dare you to try and kill me. No, wait—I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>double dog dare you</font_kind>, bitch!": "",
  "(No, I'm busy right now. Tashiro-kun's a grown man, and a yakuza at that. He can handle this by himself.)": "",
  "(You can do this, Tashiro-kun.)": "",
  "We're even now. Later, Yagami!": "",
  "Um, excuse me. My name is Nekomiya, and...": "",
  "You haven't happened to see any cute little kitties wandering around here, have you?": "",
  "Yes, in fact I'm the one who takes care of all the stray cats in Kamurocho. However, there are a few I haven't seen lately...": "",
  "I hope they aren't too hungry. I really do worry about them...": "",
  "You're looking for kitties out here?": "",
  "You think so...? How do you know they're not off dying somewhere?": "",
  "(Oh, so he's the one who feeds them. Great, now they're gonna crap all over the place...)": "",
  "But it's not just me who's concerned! The rest of the feral feline community needs to know they're safe!": "",
  "Oh yes. You see, I run a blog about all the stray cats I find... It's got cat pictures, cat icons, cat matchmaking—cat everything!": "",
  "They're street cats. They'll be fine.": "",
  "But since I can't update my subscribers about the cats that went missing, a lot of them started to panic.": "",
  "...It is a big deal to me! That's why I've been searching high and low for these crazy little critters...": "",
  "Yet for some reason, they run away at full speed whenever they see me coming!": "",
  "They're <font_kind=yakuza_italic>street cats</font_kind>. They've existed long before you came around.": "",
  "You mean... there are more of you?": "",
  "It's like, the more I offer my love, the faster they run away! Why...!? Why won't my feelings get through to them!?": "",
  "I see... Well, it sounds like it's not a big deal.": "",
  "Ah! So you know a thing or two about their behavior! Let me guess... you're also a fellow feline fanatic!?": "",
  "Either way, would you be willing to help me find my missing kitties? On behalf of the cat-loving community!?": "",
  "(Less cats means less cat poop. I say good riddance.)": "",
  "Yeah! All you'd have to do is send me their picture when you find them. Just to let me know they're still alive and kicking.": "",
  "Oh, and I'll reward you, of course! In cash!": "",
  "Please! I'm begging you! Have a little heart! These furry little fluffballs need a hero!": "",
  "Ohhhh, thank you soooo soooo much!": "",
  "Well... cats do tend to be pretty fickle, you know.": "",
  "No... Not quite.": "",
  "Oh yeah! We should exchange our contact info!": "",
  "Ah. Right. Would you mind starting off with the calico? He's a bit of a scaredy-cat, so I doubt he's gone too far.": "",
  "Great! Then I'll be counting on you, Yagami-san!": "",
  "...Okay, you've persuaded me. As long as it's just taking pictures.": "",
  "Hmm, I'm not so sure I can do that...": "",
  "(He really is attached to these helpless, filthy creatures, isn't he? Well, I guess I could lend a hand...)": "",
  "Fine. I'll do it.": "",
  "(Is this the one Nekomiya-san's looking for...?)": "",
  "I hope you find these kitties before their curiosity gets the better of them.": "",
  "Nekomiya-san, I think I found your calico. I just sent you a text.": "",
  "See, I told you he'd be just fine.": "",
  "Yep, that's the one! You've done very well, Yagami-san!": "",
  "I'm so glad he's safe... Aww, you had me so worried!": "",
  "So he's a climber, huh...": "",
  "But there are two more that haven't been found.": "",
  "I often see him in Little Asia. He always ends up in some high, hard-to-reach spot.": "",
  "All right, I'll see if I can find him.": "",
  "(Time to search for places only a cat could climb in Little Asia...)": "",
  "(Did I hear... a cat just now?)": "",
  "(That's gotta be the one! I'm sure Nekomiya-san would appreciate a picture.)": "",
  "Whew... What a relief! Yes, that's him alright. Fantastic work!": "",
  "...Okay. Looks like there's only one more to go.": "",
  "Nekomiya-san. I sent you a text. Is that the right one?": "",
  "Anyway. Our last little runaway critter is a black cat. Apparently he lives on Pink Street and is quite fond of the ladies.": "",
  "(There's a black cat over there... Maybe it's the one Nekomiya-san was talking about?)": "",
  "No, that's just a stray, but I do know the guy who takes care of him.": "",
  "Hold that thought for a moment. Let me contact him and see if we can work something out.": "",
  "Yagami-san! Were you able to find him?": "",
  "I think you should come and see for yourself.": "",
  "Huh? Is something going on?": "",
  "Ah, now I get it. She wants to raise him as her own.": "",
  "Got it! If that's the case, then please don't let me stop you. I'm just glad this little guy found himself a good home!": "",
  "You sure you're gonna be okay with that, Nekomiya-san? You won't be able to blog about him anymore.": "",
  "It's true that I'll miss him, but... if someone's willing to welcome him into their family, then I'm sure he'll live a better life.": "",
  "Please... Take good care of him.": "",
  "Mhm. All those pampered pets at the pet shop? I leave 'em for the other guys... After all, I'm a street cat man.": "",
  "Huh? If you know about my blog, then... Does that mean you're one of my subscribers?": "",
  "Really!? Wow... I'm flabbergasted! You're the first person I've met who actually reads my stuff.": "",
  "Oh! Well... I guess that's... awesome!": "",
  "Wow. You really do have a soft spot for animals, Nekomiya-san. Especially the ones that can't fend for themselves.": "",
  "Th-That would be great! It's a date, then!": "",
  "(...Don't go chasing her away, Nekomiya-san. 'Cause this kitten's yours to keep.)": "",
  "Yagami-san, I owe you one... I mean, look at me! I'm gonna go have some <font_kind=yakuza_italic>tea</font_kind> with a girl who reads my blog!": "",
  "Here's a little treat before I go. I did have you running all over the place, so...": "",
  "I'm Yagami, by the way.": "",
  "(He really is way up there... Maybe it's the tabby Nekomiya-san was talking about?)": "",
  "(I can't see much from down here. But I bet the drone can!)": "",
  "No problem. I got this under control.": "",
  "(So he likes women, huh... Guess I'll have to find this cat the hard way.)": "",
  "...So, what kind of cat should I be looking for?": "",
  "Calico. Got it.": "",
  "(Man, what a nuisance... But I guess it couldn't hurt to keep an eye out.)": "",
  "(Time to send him a picture.)": "",
  "Ah, Yagami-san! Have you found the calico yet? He's a bit of a scaredy-cat, so I doubt he's gone too far.": "",
  "(Maybe it'll pop out as I wander around town.)": "",
  "What! There's more...?": "",
  "Yes. I'd like for you to find the tabby next.": "",
  "Ready, Yagami-san? Next up is the tabby. Could you check out some high places in Little Asia?": "",
  "That's really the only hint I have for you... Sorry if that seems rather vague.": "",
  "He's a real cutie... in fact, he's practically the talk of the town! I hope he's doing okay...": "",
  "...Is there something I can help you with? Oh! Are you his owner?": "",
  "Oh, really? He sure is a cute little fella... I was actually thinking of bringing him home with me.": "",
  "But... if someone's looking for him, then I suppose I should leave him be.": "",
  "Excuse me... You wouldn't happen to run a blog called Nekomiya's Newsletter, would you?": "",
  "Aha, I knew it! So it is you! And yes, I've been subscribed to you for a long time now!": "",
  "You could even say I'm one of your biggest fans!": "",
  "Hehe... Now that I see you in person... You kinda remind me of a cat yourself. I'm into that sorta thing. ❤": "",
  "So, would you, um, like to grab some tea with me? It doesn't have to be now, but...": "",
  "I've always wanted to talk cats with the incredible Nekomiya-san!": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. Our missing feline friend lives on Pink Street and was known to be quite fond of the ladies.": "",
  "He's such a cute li'l kitty, too... I hope he's doing all right.": "",
  "Mrroww!": "",
  "Oh! Hey you, over there! I don't mean to startle you, but... could you show me your smile?": "",
  "Well, we've decided to host an event that fosters friendship between Smile Burger and the local community. Allow me to explain!": "",
  "First, each of our guests can take a Smile Snapshot with one of our Smile Staff Members...": "",
  "Then we'll post that snapshot up on our official Smile Site...": "",
  "And finally, our other customers can go online to vote on who has the winning grin! Simple enough?": "",
  "Wait, you're going to be uploading our pictures online?": "",
  "Yes! And to compensate for this blatant breach of privacy, the winner gets first dibs at trying our secret menu!": "",
  "You'll still have to pay for the food, though.": "",
  "(So, after forcing us to smile and uploading our pictures online, you still want to take our money?)": "",
  "Um, sir? Could you maybe... turn that frown upside down?": "",
  "Why not give us a smile instead!?": "",
  "Come on, don't be like that. How about taking a picture with yours truly? The name's Hanae Ida, by the way.": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm gonna have to pass. I'd rather not have people I don't know looking at my face.": "",
  "Understood. Well, the contest will be going on for quite some time, so please let me know if you change your mind!": "",
  "Welcome to Smile Burger! Would you like to take part in our Smile Contest today?": "",
  "If it's okay with you, we could always take the Smile Snapshot together. Whaddya say?": "",
  "All right, fine. I'm a sucker for a secret menu.": "",
  "Great, then let's get started! We're gonna take this one right out front!": "",
  "And... let's see that handsome smile! I know! Maybe try laughing?": "",
  "Maybe try imagining you're being tickled? I dunno, make something up!": "",
  "*sigh* What am I even doing here...": "",
  "Hmm... Well, it wasn't terrible...": "",
  "Hey, you ask me for my best smile, and then you come for my life like that?": "",
  "I'm afraid your smile still needs a little work, sir. Are you not a naturally happy person?": "",
  "No frowning, please! Just keep that grin on your chin and look forward to the results!": "",
  "Welcome to Smile Burger! Oh, it's nice to see you again!　": "",
  "Remember the Smile Snapshot we took the other day? Well, we made it to the final screening! Isn't that neat!?": "",
  "I guess that's something to smile about.": "",
  "Of course it is! With that being said... Would you like to take another one?": "",
  "There's another Smile Snapshot that's threatening your place on the ladder... They're practically your Smile Rival.": "",
  "So if you could squeeze an even <font_kind=yakuza_italic>better</font_kind> smile out of that face of yours, I'm sure you'll win this!": "",
  "An even better smile...?": "",
  "That's the spirit! I knew you had it in you! Now before, we had you posing outside the restaurant...": "",
  "This time's gonna be a little different. We'll be posing inside today.": "",
  "Now then! Let's see your very best smile!": "",
  "How's this...?": "",
  "Sir, your face looks way too stiff! I'm askin' for a happy face here! You know, like an emoji!?": "",
  "Perfect! Now that's a winner for sure!": "",
  "Hehe. That turned out pretty good, if I do say so myself!": "",
  "Hope this makes it to the top.": "",
  "Well, all we can do is wait, so please come back again soon!": "",
  "Welcome! ...Ah, it's you, sir!　": "",
  "Hey. How's our Smile Snapshot doing?": "",
  "It's been chosen for the Very Best Smile Award! Congratulations!": "",
  "What can I say? It's all thanks to you... My very own Smile Sensei.": "",
  "*giggle* You seem like you'd be a perfect fit for our next Smile Intern.": "",
  "Ahahaha... Not gonna happen.": "",
  "Aww, come on! Well, you're welcome to submit an application if you ever change your mind.": "",
  "In the meantime, I'll be doing my part by greeting every guest with the biggest smile I got!": "",
  "Then I'll come by every now and then just for that.": "",
  "Oh, that's right, I need to show you what's on the secret menu now that you won!": "",
  "Yeah, what do I get?": "",
  "You... get... the Legendary Smile Set! If it doesn't fix your smile in place, then it doesn't belong in your face!": "",
  "Now then! How can I help you today?": "",
  "That last one... was the best I could do.": "",
  "Seriously. I'm all smiled out. There's nothing left in the tank.": "",
  "Really? I'm sure you can at least give me an emergency smile...": "",
  "Maybe I need to give you some personal Smile Tutoring! Would you like that?": "",
  "Uh... I'll think about it.": "",
  "Fine by me. Let's win this thing.": "",
  "(Man... All I wanted was a burger. How do I get out of this?)": "",
  "(I finally got released...)": "",
  "(But damn, that Shibata though. I've never seen anyone on the force so dedicated to chewing me out... What a waste.)": "",
  "(Shibata gave me an earful again, as usual... It's not like I get into these fights on purpose!)": "",
  "(Shibata did seem a little quiet today... Feels kind of weird not to get yelled at for once.)": "",
  "(Apparently Shibata-san is concerned about his daughter. Of course, he said it's none of my business, but still...)": "",
  "(Apparently Shibata-san's daughter is getting married, even though she's still a student! Must be tough on a dad.)": "",
  "(Looks like Shibata-san met his daughter's fiancé, and it turns out he's a foreigner! Two worlds coming together...)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Let's be on our way.": "งั้นออกเดินทางกันเลยครับ",
  "Yeah. Give it your best shot.": "เออ ทำให้เต็มที่เลยนะ",
  "Please come again.": "แวะมาใหม่นะ",
  "Gah...!": "กืออ...!",
  "Damn you...": "ไอ้บ้าเอ๊ย...",
  "I wouldn't be so sure.": "เราไม่แน่ใจอย่างนั้นนะ",
  "...Hold up.": "...เดี๋ยวก่อน",
  "Mrroww!": "เมี้ยวว!"
 }
}
